1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,276
What if everything around you could become 3D?

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:07,895
Put on the headset… and look!

3
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:18,492
A car. I point at it, and the AI outlines it…

4
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:25,325
…draws it from every side…

5
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:34,766
…and here it is, in 3D!

6
00:00:38,250 --> 00:00:40,514
This is Mitsinjo Grid VR.

7
00:00:50,850 --> 00:00:53,354
Let's start in the kitchen. I scan the room.

8
00:00:56,850 --> 00:00:58,800
Let's take the fridge, for example.

9
00:01:03,450 --> 00:01:05,884
First, the AI draws its 2D views.

10
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:10,287
One view is wrong? I just ask for a change.

11
00:01:11,050 --> 00:01:14,891
Now I validate, and the 3D model is built, piece by piece.

12
00:01:19,550 --> 00:01:21,228
Next, the sofa in the hall.

13
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:40,223
In the lab, I pick a piece, resize it, and see right through it.

14
00:01:43,050 --> 00:01:45,028
On the terrace… even a whole house!

15
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:53,281
From its facade to 3D.

16
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:01,454
And down the street… the car.

17
00:02:16,850 --> 00:02:18,817
Any object. One pipeline.

18
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:31,161
Under the hood, Meta models: SAM 3.1 outlines it, Muse Image draws it, and Muse Spark, with skill cards and specialist agents, builds it.

19
00:02:31,050 --> 00:02:34,391
Now I place the car in the village, without leaving the headset.

20
00:02:46,300 --> 00:02:49,148
Here's the village. And here's a map, to find my way.

21
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:00,290
Fast forward to the evening.

22
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:06,770
I cut the power to these houses… the lights fade.

23
00:03:11,250 --> 00:03:12,448
And back on.

24
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:16,071
The clinic? Never cut.

25
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:25,928
Mitsinjo Grid VR. Point at the world. Build it. Power it.
